  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.6.8 - New (Edit Controls): UpdateTrigger enum + UpdateOn parameter (plus FormDefaults.UpdateOn) to choose commit-on-keystroke vs. commit-on-blur/Enter for EditString/EditTextArea/EditNumber/EditDate/the Radio \"Other\" box; [Placeholder(\"...\")] model attribute (with [Display(Prompt)] fallback) honored by EditString/EditTextArea/EditNumber/EditDatePicker/EditDateRange/EditSelectSearch/EditMultiSelect/EditSelectEnum/EditSelectString. New (UI Kit): Select.AriaErrorMessage, forwarded by EditSelectSearch/EditMultiSelect, plus aria-errormessage on EditFile. Changed: default checkbox/radio label spacing now matches AntD's 8px flex-row gap for every EditBool/EditCheckedStringList/EditCheckedEnumList/EditRadioString/EditRadioEnum/EditRadio label, not just the UseStyledCheckbox variant — a visible default-rendering change for every consumer; EditSelectSearch.Placeholder/EditMultiSelect.Placeholder are now string? (previously string, defaulted to \"Please select\"). Fixed: the new flex checkbox/radio labels are hardened against a consumer's own input flex/margin resets; EditSelectEnum ports EditSelectString's no-JS selected-option fallback for prerender/no-JS rendering; the Select engine's value-to-label lookup is unified across Select/EditSelectSearch/EditMultiSelect, fixing label drift on a duplicate-valued option list; SearchInput's clear/search buttons no longer collapse under a consumer's button height reset; the JS overlay positioning helpers are consolidated, fixing inconsistent dropdown/panel flip-to-fit behavior. Internal refactors (shared bases/components, CSS/JS/icon dedup, hoisted e2e scaffolding) and dependency/test-infra bumps (ASP.NET Core Components, bUnit, Playwright) with no consumer-facing API change. See the README changelog for details.",
